    "body": "SVGImageElement can load bitmaps just fine.  As in, there are four cases:\n\n```\n<svg:image xlink:href=\"something.svg\"> <!-- should reject here -->\n<html:img src=\"something.svg\"> <!-- should reject here -->\n<svg:image xlink:href=\"something.png\"> <!-- should work here -->\n<html:img src=\"something.png\"> <!-- should work here -->\n```\n",
