    "body": "I can assure you that is not how Blink's implementation works. We allow svg with external subresources to be drawn into a canvas. Doing so will result in the canvas's origin-clean being set to false. I am pretty sure Firefox does the same, or at least it did last time I checked, a couple years ago IIRC.\n",
